<title>USA: Harnischfeger Industries Inc Q4 Oct 31 net.</title>
<headline>Harnischfeger Industries Inc Q4 Oct 31 net.</headline>
<dateline>MILWAUKEE, Wis. 1996-11-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.41		    $0.51</p>
<p> Net			 19,779		   23,445</p>
<p> Revs		     715,463		  623,274</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  47,560		   46,680</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Q4 1996 net income after $43,000,000 restructuring charge. Operating income before charge $0.87 a share.</p>
<p>Q4 1995 net income after loss of $6,825,000, or $0.14 a share, from discontinued operations.  </p>
<p>Excluding discontinued operations, Q4 1995 income $0.65/share.</p>
<p>		     YEAR</p>
<p> Shr			  $2.42		    $1.24</p>
<p> Net			114,217		   57,404</p>
<p> Revs		   2,887,570		2,184,287</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  47,196		   46,218</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Fiscal 1996 results after $43,000,000 restructuring charge. Excluding charge, income was $2.88 a share.</p>
<p>Fiscal 1995 results after $11,384,000 in costs for Joy merger, $18,657,000 gain on sale of Measurex investment, loss of $31,235,000, or $0.67 a share, from discontinued operation and loss of $3,481,000, or $0.08 a share, on retirement of debt. Excluding all items, fiscal 1995 income was $1.83 a share.</p>
